{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10137080","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10137080","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1013708001:0":{"text":"샤키르가 말한 영지가 이 블랙골드 영지겠죠?","source_cn":"沙奎尔说的，应该就是这片黑金营地吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAAE2BB0FF3BF2E4D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1013708002:0":{"text":"음... 안에 정말로 커다랗고 무서운 골렘이 있을까요?","source_cn":"唔……里面会有可怕的大魔偶吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98121DAEBDF598F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1013708003:0":{"text":"우선 지금은 없는 것 같아. 그런데 어떤 눈치 없는 녀석이 길을 막으려는 것 같은데?","source_cn":"暂时没看到魔偶。不过，倒是有些不长眼的家伙想拦路呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C966542215760E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1013708004:0":{"text":"더 이상 시간 낭비할 수 없으니, 속전속결하도록 하죠.","source_cn":"不能再浪费时间了，我们速战速决。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB551A54BED273B47","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:特弥希娅":{"text":"테미히아","source":"特弥希娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:阿塔兰忒":{"text":"아탈란테","source":"阿塔兰忒","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":3}}